k first steps within minutes of birth]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133035188.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/toronto-gets-its-own-moo-deng-pygmy-hippo-calf-born-to-20-year-old-mother-took-first-steps-within-minutes-of-birth/articleshow/133035188.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/toronto-gets-its-own-moo-deng-pygmy-hippo-calf-born-to-20-year-old-mother-took-first-steps-within-minutes-of-birth/articleshow/133035188.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-07T18:53:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133035255,imgsize-221828.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[One man began clearing dumped trash alone; his daily cleanups grew into a 100-volunteer movement]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133034407.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Houston resident's initiative to clean up neglected areas has blossomed into a vibrant volunteer movement. With one hundred dedicated individuals now on board, their mission is to remove illegally dumped waste. Collaborating with local organizations and harnessing the power of social media, city officials and law enforcement are boosting efforts to tackle this pressing issue, ultimately enhancing the community's aesthetics and the well-being of its residents.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/one-houston-man-began-clearing-illegally-dumped-trash-alone-his-daily-cleanups-grew-into-a-100-volunteer-movement/articleshow/133034407.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/one-houston-man-began-clearing-illegally-dumped-trash-alone-his-daily-cleanups-grew-into-a-100-volunteer-movement/articleshow/133034407.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-07T18:51:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133035155,imgsize-1595001.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Video: 2 injured after gunman opens fire near New York subway station]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133034524.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/video-2-injured-after-gunman-opens-fire-near-new-york-subway-station/articleshow/133034524.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/video-2-injured-after-gunman-opens-fire-near-new-york-subway-station/articleshow/133034524.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-07T18:38:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133034980,imgsize-1384978.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists watched a 1km-wide, 100m-thick section of Greenland’s Sorgenfri glacier break away]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133033581.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a striking display of nature, a massive section of a Greenland glacier detached and collapsed into the sea, captured by scientists on a research vessel. This occurrence unfolded as part of a study examining the implications of meltwater runoff on major ocean currents. Advanced autonomous robots are being utilized to collect vital data from the hazardous ice face.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/scientists-aboard-rrs-sir-david-attenboro